{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光，展示了影片中的大規模動作戲。從畫面來看，現場警燈交錯、車輛密集，氣氛相當緊張。《新蝙蝠俠2》由馬特·裏夫斯繼續執導，羅伯特·帕丁森回歸飾演蝙蝠俠。傑弗裏·懷特、安迪·瑟金斯、科林·法瑞爾等演員也將回歸，同時加入塞巴斯蒂安·斯坦、斯嘉麗·約翰遜等新演員。目前影片劇情仍處於高度保密狀態。</p>\n<p>《新蝙蝠俠2》定於2028年2月18日在北美上映。</p>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702410_186321_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702410_146334_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702410_506329_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702620_744891_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702620_622625_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702620_787529_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702620_810042_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702410_977538_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702410_186321_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702410_146334_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702410_506329_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702620_744891_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702620_622625_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702620_787529_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《新蝙蝠俠2》片場照曝光 警燈交錯氣氛緊張\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260906/1788702620_810042_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T18:38:13.773784+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":15,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}